          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1 - Gordon Wilson\t\t      ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "textStyle",
                "attrs": {
                  "color": "#FFBF00"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hello! My name´s Gordon Wilson. I come from Aberdeen in Scotland, but now I live and work in London. I have a very small flat near the centre. I´m a waiter and I´m also a drama student. I work in an Italian restaurant. I eat Italian food and I drink Italian and French wine. I don't drink beer. I don't like it. And I don´t play sports. I speak three languages – English, French, and a little Italian. I want to be an actor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2 - House\t\t\t\t  ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "textStyle",
                "attrs": {
                  "color": "#FFBF00"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I am in my house with my father and my mother. My mother is a good mother. She is a housewife. My father is a very busy man, but he is also a good father. I have a brother and a sister. My sister is funny. She is in school. My brother is very smart. He is playing ball."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I am a girl. I am reading a book. I like to read. My dog is sleeping. I like my dog. It's a good dog."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I love my family!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
